---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import { contact } from '../../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for Iron Path Services.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy <em>Policy.</em>" lead="Last updated June 6, 2026." />

  <section class="section">
    <article class="narrow card sand">
      <p>Iron Path Services LLC respects your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and how to contact us with questions.</p>
      <h3>Information we collect</h3>
      <p>We may collect your name, phone number, email address, service address, preferred contact method, requested services, messages, review submissions, newsletter signups, and information you voluntarily provide through website forms, email, phone, text, WhatsApp, or social media.</p>
      <h3>How we use information</h3>
      <p>We use information to respond to requests, prepare estimates, schedule work, process reviews after manual approval, send service updates, improve the website, maintain records, and comply with legal or business obligations.</p>
      <h3>Website forms and email routing</h3>
      <p>Website submissions may be routed through email, Tally forms, and Google tools, including Google Forms. Information submitted through those tools is also subject to the applicable Tally or Google terms and privacy policies.</p>
      <h3>Sharing</h3>
      <p>We do not sell personal information. We may share information with service providers, payment processors, Tally and Google form tools, email routing tools, or legal authorities when necessary to operate the business, complete requested services, protect rights, or comply with law.</p>
      <h3>Photos and reviews</h3>
      <p>Before-and-after job photos may be used for documentation. Public use of identifiable images requires approval. Reviews are manually approved before publication.</p>
      <h3>Security</h3>
      <p>We use reasonable administrative and technical safeguards, but no website or email system can be guaranteed perfectly secure.</p>
      <h3>Your choices</h3>
      <p>You may request updates, corrections, or deletion of your information where legally and operationally possible. You may unsubscribe from newsletter messages at any time.</p>
      <h3>Contact</h3>
      <p>Questions can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${contact.leadsEmail}`}>{contact.leadsEmail}</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
